--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Voice clips (audio/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The English sentences, the facts and the Polish translations were generated
with the Microsoft Edge text-to-speech service (neural voices Sonia, Ava and
Andrew; Polish: Zofia). They are not covered by the AGPL or by any Creative
Commons license; Microsoft's terms for that service apply to them.
